# The overseer, autoscaler and dataguard images build from the REPOSITORY ROOT,
# because they share signals/ — and dataguard also shares pki/ with the panel.
# Without this every build ships the git history and the panel's 480KB preview
# artefact into the daemon for no reason.
.git
.idea
.claude
admin/preview
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
docs

# The workflow that publishes the images. Nothing in the build needs it.
.github
